chmlib-ts is a pure TypeScript library for reading Microsoft HTML Help
(.chm) archives. It is a port of chmlib by Jed Wing, with LZX
decompression derived from cabextract by Stuart Caie.

This directory vendors the core runtime sources of chmlib-ts
(https://github.com/dmihal/chmlib-ts) for use inside kookit. Only the
library sources are included; the Node.js CLI and its helpers are not
part of this vendored copy.

The original chmlib (and therefore this port) is distributed under the
terms of the GNU Lesser General Public License version 2.1. The
original COPYING file and AUTHORS list from chmlib-ts are preserved in
this directory.
